[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16742.789, "timestamp": "04:39:02", "text": "四，五。我想这就是全部内容了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16745.91, "timestamp": "04:39:05", "text": "不，这并非全部。约翰，那里有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16764.029, "timestamp": "04:39:24", "text": "那里。啊。啊。啊。它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16766.349, "timestamp": "04:39:26", "text": "疼。什么是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16786.47, "timestamp": "04:39:46", "text": "正是这一点，这些酒让我想起了这一点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16789.91, "timestamp": "04:39:49", "text": "我好像玩过那个……呃……朝圣者游戏之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16797.868, "timestamp": "04:39:57", "text": "游戏。我记得当时我在看"}]